<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"
    xmlns:ev="http://www.w3.org/2001/xml-events"
    xmlns:w2="http://www.inswave.com/websquare" xmlns:xf="http://www.w3.org/2002/xforms">
    <head>
    	<w2:type>DEFAULT</w2:type>
        <w2:buildDate/>
        <xf:model>
            <xf:instance>
                <data xmlns=""/>
            </xf:instance>
            <w2:dataCollection baseNode="map">
            </w2:dataCollection>
            <w2:workflowCollection>
            </w2:workflowCollection>
        </xf:model>
         <script type="text/javascript" lazy="false"><![CDATA[
        
	scwin.onpageload = function() {
		
	};
	
	scwin.onpageunload = function() {
		
	};
	
	]]></script>
    </head>
    <body ev:onpageload="scwin.onpageload" ev:onpageunload="scwin.onpageunload">
    <xf:group id="" style="margin: 10px;"><w2:textbox tagname="h1" style="color: blue;margin-bottom: 10px;" tabIndex="h1" id="textbox1" label="날짜 입출력 형식 (정적) 설정" escape="false"></w2:textbox><w2:textbox tagname="h2" style="height: 23px;margin-bottom: 10px;color: blue;" id="textbox2" label="샘플 사용 방법"></w2:textbox><w2:textbox style="color: blue;margin-bottom: 30px;" id="textbox3" label='1. InputCalendar의 입력 상자에 ioFormat 속성 설정에 따라 날짜를 입력. (예: "11112025")&lt;br/&gt;2. Enter 키를 선택. &lt;br/&gt;3. displayFormat 속성 설정에 따라 입력한 날짜가 표시되는 것을 확인. &amp;nbsp;(예: "11-11-2025")&lt;br/&gt;4. InputCalendar의 달력 아이콘을 클릭. &lt;br/&gt;5. calendarDisplayFormat 속성 설정에 따라 달력의 우측 하단에 입력한 날짜가 표시되는 것을 확인. &amp;nbsp;(예: "11 : 11 : 2025")&lt;br/&gt;' escape="false">
    	</w2:textbox><w2:textbox style="padding:5px;text-align:left;font-size: 15px;font-weight:bolder;background-color: lightblue;border:none;margin-bottom: 10px;" id="textbox4" label='속성 설정&lt;br/&gt;ioFormat="MMddyyyy" &lt;br/&gt;displayFormat="MM-dd-yyyy" &lt;br/&gt;calendarDisplayFormat="MM : dd : yyyy"' escape="false">
    	</w2:textbox><w2:inputCalendar minYear="1900" footerDiv="false" focusOnDateSelect="false" displayFormat="MM-dd-yyyy" calendarDisplayFormat="MM : dd : yyyy" calendarValueType="yearMonthDate" ioFormat="MMddyyyy" displayFormatFunc="" maxYear="2050" rightAlign="false" style="" id="inputCalendar1" renderType="component" renderDiv="true" monthNames="Jan,Feb,Mar,Apr,May,Jun,Jul,Aug,Sep,Oct,Nov,Dec" yearSuffix="Y">
    	</w2:inputCalendar></xf:group></body>
</html>
